OL,3,GNEWSABurst pipe leaves 6,000 properties
OL,4,Awithout water
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo bottled water stations have been
OL,7,Fset up at Sainsbury's car park on
OL,8,FSandringham Way in Amblecote and at
OL,9,FKing George V Park on Lawnswood Road in
OL,10,FWordsley.
OL,12,FHoward Perry, Severn Trent Water's head
OL,13,Fof water quality, said while progress
OL,14,Fwas being made the scale of the problem
OL,15,Fwas still large.
